Rb3 c2 {Sources: Glasgow Herald, 5 Sep 1931; New York Sun, 4 December 1931;
BCM, Sept 1931, p409 (from Black's move 35). Rec'd from Gerard Killoran, 11
Jan 2016. The Times, Wednesday 19 August 1931, gives this game as being played
in the 7th round - but it also gives Broadbent as playing Znosko-Borovsky in
the same round! On balance I think the mistake is in the round number of the
Broadbent game and not this one. JS} 0-1

